# Original. Written *for* the reconstruction rather than against it.
#
# Wide, slow chords whose fits overlap heavily, so the negative coefficients
# have somewhere to cancel and the beating between mismatched partials becomes
# the point. On "True" this is an unremarkable pad; the interesting version is
# the one assembled out of notes that aren't being played.

tempo 46
meter 4

track pad
  A2+E3+A3:w
  A2+E3+C4:w
  F2+C3+A3:w
  F2+C3+G3:w
  G2+D3+B3:w
  G2+D3+D4:w
  E2+B2+G3:w
  A2+E3+A3:w

track bell gain 0.55
  -:h A4:h
  -:q C5:q -:h
  -:h E4:h
  -:q A4:h -:q
  -:h B4:h
  -:q D5:q -:h
  -:h G4:h
  A4:w
